>spinning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">setSpinning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> createSignal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"包裹一段内容\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Spin</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> spinning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">spinning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()} </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">tip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"正在提交审核\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"min-height: 96px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>维简设备采购计划 · 2026 年第三批&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>本次采购数量 12 台，本次采购单价 8.6 万&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Spin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> setSpinning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">value)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          {</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">spinning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> '结束加载'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> '开始加载'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"无文案（读屏仍有「加载中」）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Spin</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"min-height: 72px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>设备台账&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Spin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
